{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">《死有對証》昨晚（1日）迎來高潮！一直對女友千依百順的高俊（馬貫東飾）終於發現美寧（王菲飾）出軌！最令人心痛的是，高俊為了幫女友償還三千萬巨債，甚至打算賣樓套現，絕對是有情有義的「絕世好男友」，點知換來的竟然是一頂超級大綠帽。</span></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-09-29 下午12.27.42.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/202603kso7MtaJ1790906271.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"螢幕截圖 2026-09-29 下午12.27.42.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">劇情講到，高俊無意中得到 Michael（黃俊豪飾）的車 Cam 片，竟親眼目睹女友與對方的「車震」激戰過程，震驚又心碎！高俊忍痛攤牌，美寧初時還想狡辯挽回，但見鐵證如山，竟然將個波推番畀男友，爆出渣女金句：「其實同你一齊咁多年我都好唔開心，因為我想要嘅嘢，你根本畀唔到我，我想同你分手好耐，依家咁樣咪仲好，一了百了！」面對女友的無情反咬，高俊雙眼通紅，最終忍不住落下男兒淚，精湛演技絕對令觀眾睇到眼濕濕。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-09-29 下午12.27.29.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026oaT6jI1Nes1790906270.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"螢幕截圖 2026-09-29 下午12.27.29.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">這場引起網民極大關注的「車震戲」，原來幕後拍攝相當順利！王菲接受 </span><a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"http://tvb.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">tvb.com</span></a><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> 獨家訪問時透露，拍攝前導演特別為他們做心理輔導：「導演叫我哋放膽啲，因為佢話若果我哋就住就住，出嚟個效果尷尷尬尬會唔好睇。」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">為了呈現最真實的效果，王菲與 Jeremy 徹底拋開包袱，全程投入角色。她開心表示出來的效果比想像中好：「因為喺架車度都拍咗好多唔同角度，拍咗好多個 Take，好彩每一個 Take 係愈嚟愈好，所有嘢都好順暢，導演都好滿意！」</span></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-09-29 下午12.26.57.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026jttMRwipmW1790906272.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"螢幕截圖 2026-09-29 下午12.26.57.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-09-29 下午12.27.54.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20264GNMUSflet1790906271.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"螢幕截圖 2026-09-29 下午12.27.54.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-09-29 下午3.13.55.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026hXmIlfRjYW1790906272.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"螢幕截圖 2026-09-29 下午3.13.55.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-02T02:39:35.826040+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":535,"images":5,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}